			ItemID._4DOSE2DEFENSE, 3, ItemID.TORSTOL, 10), 99);
		assertEquals(3, plan.getMakeable());
		assertTrue(steps(plan), steps(plan).contains("Super defence: short 10 cadantine, 10 vial of water, 10 white berries"));
	}

